      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find YouTube creators with business emails to Google Sheets\n\nSearch YouTube channels by keyword, keep those with a public business email (bio or creator website, MX-checked) and store them with subscribers and country in a Google Sheet. Influencer outreach on autopilot.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Find YouTube channels with email** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Find YouTube channels with email** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $0.0005 per channel checked + $0.004 per email found. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/youtube-channel-email-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
